---
import Legal from '../../layouts/Legal.astro';
import { SITE } from '../../config';
---

<Legal
  lang="en"
  title="Privacy Policy | PISMA"
  description="What data pisma.gr collects through its forms and visit statistics, why, for how long, and what your rights are."
  heading="Privacy Policy"
  sub="What we keep, why, for how long. And how to ask for it back."
  updated="2026-09-11"
>
  <h2>Who we are</h2>
  <p>
    pisma.gr belongs to PISMA ("we"). For any question about your personal data, write to
    <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>, call
    <a href={`tel:${SITE.phone.replace(/\s/g, '')}`}>{SITE.phone}</a>, or message us on
    <a href={SITE.whatsapp} target="_blank" rel="noopener">WhatsApp</a> or <a href={SITE.viber}>Viber</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>What we collect and why</h2>
  <h3>Contact, Check, quote and order forms</h3>
  <p>
    When you fill in a form on this site, you send us what you type into it: your name, business name, phone, email,
    your message and, on the pricing and sticker forms, a summary of what you selected.
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Purpose:</strong> to reply to your request, book the Check or prepare a quote.</li>
    <li><strong>Legal basis:</strong> the steps before a collaboration you ask for (Article 6(1)(b) GDPR) and our legitimate interest in answering whoever writes to us.</li>
    <li><strong>Where it goes:</strong> the form is delivered as an email to {SITE.email} through the FormSubmit service (formsubmit.co), which does not keep your details for its own purposes.</li>
    <li><strong>For how long:</strong> as long as needed to handle the request and, if a collaboration starts, for its duration and for as long as tax law requires.</li>
  </ul>

  <h3>Visit statistics (Google Analytics)</h3>
  <p>
    We use Google Analytics 4 for anonymous statistics: which pages are read, on what device, for how long. It loads
    <strong>only if you press "Accept"</strong> on the banner. Before that, no statistics cookie is set. Your IP
    address is anonymised. The data is processed by Google Ireland Limited, with the safeguards the GDPR requires for
    any transfer outside the EU.
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Legal basis:</strong> your consent (Article 6(1)(a) GDPR), which you can withdraw at any time.</li>
    <li><strong>For how long:</strong> Google Analytics cookies (_ga, _ga_*) last up to 2 years from your last visit.</li>
  </ul>

  <h3>Technical hosting data</h3>
  <p>
    The site is hosted on Vercel. Like any server, it temporarily logs technical details of each request (IP address,
    browser type, time) for the security and operation of the service. We do not combine these with your name.
  </p>

  <h2>Cookies and browser storage</h2>
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr><th>Name</th><th>What it does</th><th>Duration</th></tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr><td>pisma-consent</td><td>Remembers whether you accepted or declined statistics. Stored in your browser, not on our server.</td><td>Until you clear your browser data</td></tr>
      <tr><td>pisma-sound</td><td>Remembers whether you turned the menu sounds off.</td><td>Until you clear your browser data</td></tr>
      <tr><td>pisma-intro</td><td>Shows the homepage intro effect once per visit.</td><td>Until the tab is closed</td></tr>
      <tr><td>_ga, _ga_*</td><td>Google Analytics cookies, only after "Accept".</td><td>Up to 2 years</td></tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>
  <p>
    To change your choice about statistics, clear this site's data in your browser. The banner will appear again on
    your next visit.
  </p>

  <h2>Links to third parties</h2>
  <p>
    The site links to WhatsApp, Viber and our clients' websites. Once you open them, their own privacy policy applies.
    We show no ads and we do not sell or share your details with third parties for their own purposes.
  </p>

  <h2>Your rights</h2>
  <p>Under the General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR) and Greek law 4624/2019 you can, at any time:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>find out what data we hold about you and get a copy,</li>
    <li>ask for it to be corrected or deleted,</li>
    <li>ask for processing to be restricted, or object to it,</li>
    <li>withdraw your consent for statistics,</li>
    <li>lodge a complaint with the Hellenic Data Protection Authority (<a href="https://www.dpa.gr" target="_blank" rel="noopener">dpa.gr</a>).</li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    To exercise any right, email <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>. We reply within one month at
    the latest.
  </p>

  <h2>Minors</h2>
  <p>Our services are addressed to businesses. We do not knowingly collect data from anyone under 16.</p>

  <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
  <p>
    If anything described here changes, we will update this page and the date at the end of it. See also our
    <a href="/en/terms/">Terms of Use</a>.
  </p>
</Legal>
